window.products.push({"id":815033,"name":"Vaukki Laundry Room Runner Rug, Farmhouse Kitchen Floor Mat, Non-Slip Waterproof Rug Runner, Rubber Plaid Hallway Rug for Laundry Room, Mudroom, Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-am6jCuPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Non Slip Laundry Rugs Runner] The waterproof rug uses premium rubber non skid backing, which is more slip-resistance than other cotton backings, PVC backings, TPR backings and polyester backings. And the farmhouse runner rug adopts clear and cute patterns, which will help you add chic and comfort to your home. [Easy to Clean] The rug for laundry room is very easy to clean. You can clean it with a damp cloth or a wet sponge. Or you can use the vacuum cleaner to clean the hallway runner rugs, which will save you more time. In addition, the entryway rugs are very soft, which can avoid fatigue caused by prolonged washing clothes or standing up while preparing dinner. [Multiple Uses] The non slip runner rug is fabulous, which can be perfectly matched with towels and other laundry room decorations and accessories. Perfect for various occasions such as in front of the sink, laundry room, parties, bathroom, living room, kitchen, bedroom, entrances, hallways, patio entryway, pet house, and so on. It is also ideal as a gift for your friends, parents, kids and family. [Farmhouse Laundry Room Rugs] The laundry rug for laundry room is made of 0.19 inches / 5mm thick high quality rubber foam materials, it may have a little smell after being opened. You can put it in a ventilated place for a few days. The rubber runner for laundry room is not easy to fade and durable. The laundry runner rug measures 20 X 59 inches, which is wider and bigger than other laundry rugs on the market. The rug for laundry room is suitable for all types of large and small laundry rooms. [Warning and Guarantee] Before placing the plaid laundry carpet for laundry room on the floor, make sure that the ground where it will be placed should be clean, flat and dry. If there is water or dust under the farmhouse sink mat, it may cause slippage. If you are dissatisfied with our plaid hallway runner rug, please contact us and we will help you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-am6jCuPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vaukki","source_asin":"B092PMXH2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092PMXH2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092PMXH2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
