window.products.push({"id":815240,"name":"Kenroy Home 51077BLGRCR Flame Floor Fountain with Black Finish, Modern Style, 35.13\" Height, 11.38\" Width, 9.63\" Depth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91481bDr1CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"While it looks like twin flames flicker and dance from on top of these ridged monoliths, the effect is simply a trick of the light: a bubbling stream of water combines with an LED light, creating a mesmerizing effect that reflects off the dark surface of the surrounding cream and gray frame. Cascading water glimmers and highlights the green-gray hues of the twin black ridged rectangles before falling into the square basin below. The clean lines paired with the rough stone finish and dark color palette is Asian-influenced and infused with plenty of contemporary style for an edgy, yet tranquil look. This jaw-dropping profile is the perfect finishing touch for a contemporary spa-like backyard retreat or as its own industrial modern work of art.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91481bDr1CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenroy Home","source_asin":"B082PM89TC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082PM89TC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082PM89TC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
