window.products.push({"id":815261,"name":"Katherine's Collection 2021 Santa Claus is Coming to Town Reindeer on Strike Candy Container","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":142.62,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sWgbgRvEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIER ARTISTRY. Every signature piece is developed in the design studios in northeast Ohio. In the age of 3D printing and automation, handcrafted pieces of superior quality have become increasingly rare. That is why the company is so committed to hiring the most talented artists in the industry. The design team has extensive skills that include pattern making, sculpting, painting, and illustrating. PLAYFUL AND FUN. Whether you’ve been naughty or nice this year, the jolly Santa featured in this theme will gladly bring good cheer to any home or Christmas retail displays. Vibrant greens and a bold cerise are sure to awaken the holiday spirit in even the most curmudgeonly naysayers. An overworked reindeer, a life-sized old lady doll, and impish Katherine’s Collection elves round out this eccentric line DECK THE HALLS. The Reindeer on Strike Candy Container measures 13×5×10 inches. This collection features a traditional take on the Christmas theme. A funny interpretation of what would happen if the reindeer should go on strike. A functional and decorative piece on your table for candies, chocolates, and other sweets. LOVELY GIFT. If you're looking for a unique and beautiful gift for a loved one, choose any piece from Katherine's Collection. They make wonderful wedding presents, housewarming token, or a gift for your colleague or boss. Make birthdays, Mother's Day, and other celebrations a memorable one through these decorative pieces. FROM HUMBLE BEGINNINGS. For 30 years, Katherine’s Collection has always been dedicated to creating a broad range of original, top-quality products each year. The company prides itself on delighting their collectors around the world with original character dolls, handcrafted creations, and holiday decor. Their artisanal approach has not stopped them from becoming an internationally requested brand and leader in the holiday decor industry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sWgbgRvEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Katherine's Collection","source_asin":"B08T99TX12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T99TX12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T99TX12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
