window.products.push({"id":815270,"name":"SunnyRoyal Topiary Ball Artificial Outdoor Boxwood Balls Topiary Lifelike Plants, Round Topiary for Indoor/Outdoor Decore, Sempreverde Green 15 Inch, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710TcysTgQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Artificial Topiary Ball - The Artificial Leaf Balls are designed to look full and realistic, and the placement of the leaves allow them to bunch together to create a beautiful, full, seamless look and create a dense ball of realistic-looking foliage that would normally take years to create and hours to maintain. Easy to Care - Each style includes a hassle-free, no maintenance design. There is no need for water, trimming, or soil to maintain the vibrancy of real leaves. The realistic moss balls are a vibrant, beautiful décor piece to make an area livelier or to add a touch of style to any setting. They are meant to enhance or even be the centerpiece of any area. Eco-friendly Material - The artificial plant ball is made from high-quality plastic by modern technology, every stem is made of super-strong high density PVC and contains 62 layers, durability and UV protection. Look the same as the real but more long-lasting than it, perfect for both indoor and outdoor decor. Artificial Outdoor/Indoor Use: Artificial boxwood balls are ideal decorations for home entrances, gardens, porches, courtyards, reception areas, offices, weddings, parties and more, adding a touch of color to your home, business, party or wedding decor. It can be used indoors or outdoors to enhance the appearance of any space. Size - The Artificial Leaf Ball are available in different packs with specific quantities, with size options of either 8\", 11\" or 15\" Artificial Leaf Balls.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710TcysTgQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SunnyRoyal","source_asin":"B08778N67R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08778N67R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08778N67R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":815271,"name":"Dennis East 8.5\" Carved Wood Shore Bird - Orange Dots","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hTosIxnNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Accentuate your seaside theme party by featuring an attractive carved wood shore bird in one or more highly visual areas. Crafted from natural wood and painted in a weathered style, this sturdy statuette evokes the beauty of the beach shoreline while tying in the decor with a polished yet understated charm. Comes in assorted styles.8.5\" tall x 9.5\" long7 oz.Painted wood/metal1 of 6 assorted stylesThere are more than 50 species of shore birds in North America, ranging in size from 6\" to 24\". Their similarity makes them very hard to identify especially considering that their plumage will vary from bright colors when breeding to dull browns & greys in the winter. For more detail on specific shore birds visit http://www.birds-of-north-america.net/shorebirds.html.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hTosIxnNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dennis East","source_asin":"B0090HJJ5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0090HJJ5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0090HJJ5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
