window.products.push({"id":815350,"name":"Bacon Grease Container with Fine Mesh Strainer - 1.7L / 6.8 Cups Cooking Oil Storage Can with Removable Dustproof Lid and Coaster Tray - Oil Pot for U","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tbz7FCUnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Superior Quality】Our bacon grease container and fine mesh strainer are made from food-grade 304 stainless steel, which is highly resistant to high temperatures and corrosion, making it safe to use. Both sides are coated with a double layer to prevent rusting, ensure a non-stick surface, and extend its lifespan. The bakelite handle is well-suited to your hand and is less prone to getting hot. 【Perfect Design】The grease container comes with a dust-proof lid that prevents dust from falling into the oil, a removable mesh strainer, and a comfortable, humanized handle. The non-slip coaster tray prevents oil from dripping onto the counter, and the small pour spout design effectively prevents any leakage. 【Large Capacity & Versatility】Our unibody design without rivets ensures that the oil pot won't leak. This cooking oil storage can hold up to 6.8 cups / 1.7L of oil, allowing you to safely separate large amounts of frying oil and reuse cooking oil. Filter oil, store oil, use oil, multi-purpose, one pot to meet the daily needs of the family. 【Efficient Straining】Cooking oil storager with a fine mesh strainer is designed to filter out any impurities or solids in the bacon grease, such as small bits of bacon or burnt pieces. The fine mesh strainer ensures that the grease is strained efficiently, and no impurities remain in the container. This cleaner and more usable bacon grease can be reused in cooking. 【Easy to Clean】Our bacon grease containers are dishwasher safe and can be easily wiped down with soap and water. The non-stick coating on the inside of the containers makes cleaning even easier. Please note that the strainer cannot be soaked while cleaning. Cannot be heated directly on the fire.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tbz7FCUnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GameXcel","source_asin":"B08F5CY3G6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F5CY3G6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F5CY3G6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
