window.products.push({"id":815666,"name":"SearchI Seat Covers for Dining Chairs, 6 Pack Water Repellent Jacquard Stretchable Dining Room Chair Seat Covers, Kitchen Chair Seat Covers Protectors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VtK9GEN3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Material】High quality products means every detail is of high standard. Made of high quality polyester and spandex fabric, SearchI chair seat covers have premium properties of High stretch, ultra softness and good durability. Upgraded drawstrings are durable and not easy to break or fall apart. Processed with unique dyeing technics, the chair covers features good color fastness and will not fade easily. 【Water-Repellent Chair Covers】SearchI dining seat cover is a very easy and fairly affordable solution to give your beloved chair protection. The fabric has been processed waterproof coating, so the seat chair covers can protect your seat chairs from water or other fluid stains. Mind that the WATER-REPELLENT chair covers can resist water at a certain level but not fully. Also, the chair seat slipcovers can protect your chairs from stains, dirt, bites and hairs of pets. 【Perfectly Fit】The upgraded drawstring and non-slip elastic bottom design will keep the chair cover fit your chair more firmly, so they won`t move around when you sit on the chair. The seat covers for dining room chairs fit seat cushion length 14''-19''; width 14''-19''; thickness 1.5''-3''. Perfect for dining chair, office chair, bar chair, etc. Please kindly measure your chairs before ordering. 【Aesthetic Decor】As time goes by, your well-used chair probably show signs of everyday wear and tear. With these well-designed chair seat covers, you can give your beloved chair a whole new lease of life with very little cost or effort. They come in vivid colors and exquisite patterns, and you can match them with other furniture to create a pleasant dinner atmosphere. As chair cover changes, so can your daily life. 【Easy Care】Only few steps you can finish the installation. Just gently place the cover on the seat cushion and button up, equipped with elastic straps, then the cover will fit your chair perfectly. our seat chair covers are Machine Washable. Just wash in cold water and gentle cycle, tumble dry low, do not iron and bleach. Please contact us if any questions about products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VtK9GEN3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SearchI","source_asin":"B0B5KZR1VM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5KZR1VM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5KZR1VM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":815667,"name":"Chef'sChoice 2000 2 Stage Professional Knife Sharpener, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":453.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DdolrFI-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A sharp knife is a safe knife, so keep your knives looking and cutting like new with this Edgecraft Chef's Choice 2000 Commercial electric knife sharpener. This professional, electric knife sharpener safely and quickly gives kitchen, sports, and pocket knives an incredibly sharp, long-lasting edge. With a two-stage system that utilizes 100% diamond technology, the Chef's Choice 2000 Commercial electric knife sharpener allows you to sharpen both straight and serrated knives. The first stage utilizes cone-shaped disks with abrasives to remove the old weak edge and produce a bevel. The second stage then implements slightly different disks to create a second bevel and remove any burr, thus producing an ultrasharp edge. The Chef's Choice Model 2000 features an easily removable module for cleaning in a dishwasher or a sink. Built-in elastomeric springs hold the knife blade securely against the angle guides, eliminating the guesswork and guaranteeing a properly sharpened knife. No honing oils or water required. This unit features outstanding durability to stand up to the rigors of a fast-paced kitchen and every-day use. It requires a 120V electrical connection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DdolrFI-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef’sChoice","source_asin":"B00009R5OW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00009R5OW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00009R5OW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
