window.products.push({"id":815741,"name":"Nicehill Storage Ottoman with Wooden Legs, Faux Leather Ottoman with Storage for Living Room, Bedroom & Hallway, Folding Storage Ottoman Bench Support","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gSYvwdyAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional Ottoman With Storage】Nicehill Storage Ottoman can be a stylish storage solution for pillows, blankets, sheets, clothes, toys, food and many other sundries in any room of your home. The storage ottoman bench can add extra spacing & seating, which will make your life in order. And it also works great as ottoman foot rest, bed bench, toy chest, entryway bench, window bench, shoe bench, step stool. 【2022 Innovation Design】Elegant European style gourd legs, rhombus thicken sponge padding-top without stitching lines, these new designs bring our ottoman storage bench more elegant & furniture-like looking and tactile impression, perfectly integrated into various style home scenes. The wooden legs of ottoman can prevent direct contact with the ground for moisture-proof storage and easier clean. 【Premium Material for Stability & Comfort】Crafted with premium faux leather, highly resilient sponge padding, sturdy Medium Density Fiberboard, and engineered wood, our stable storage ottoman bench can provide great seating experience and lasting use. The side of the lid is extended to 1.57inch, which is 33% wider than others, so that the whole structure can be more sturdy and not easy to shake or tilt over. 【Easy to Assemble & Good Service】Please following the installation videos, you will find the assembly is super easy. Unfolding, position base piece, set the metal bracket between the storage ottoman and the leg rightly, then spin the leg right and they will tighten up. (Tips: the metal bracket can provide added support/protection for the ottoman, please ensure the protruding edges of the metal bracket wrap the edge of the ottoman.) Feel free to contact us, we will reply you within 24 hours. 【Humanized design & Easy to Remove】Simply remove the wooden leg and fold the storage ottoman when out of use, it only takes up little space when folded (30\" L x 15\" W x 3.3\" H). And with a lightweight design (15.4 LBS) for handling, Nicehill ottoman storage can be moved easily to any home, living room, bedroom, kid's playroom, office, fashion closet, college dorm, studio apartment, etc. 【Dimensions & Materials】Open: 30\" L x 15\" W x 15\" H; Folded: 30\" L x 15\" W x 3.3\" H. Materials: 30% PU, 30% MDF, 5% Polyester, 5% Sponge, 5% Non-woven Fabric, 4 Wooden legs, 4 metal plates, 4 non-skip pads.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gSYvwdyAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nicehill","source_asin":"B0BNQ91D16","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNQ91D16","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNQ91D16","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
