window.products.push({"id":815761,"name":"Porcelain Gaiwan 5oz /150ml Teacup White Glazed Classical Chinese Auspicious Clouds Tea Cup Tureen Sancai Cover Bowl Lid Cup Saucer Set (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617AeXpC7UL._AC_SL1322_.jpg","description":"Gaiwan total height:8.9cm Cup diameter 9.2cm,Cup hight 6.0cm Cup maximum capacity:160ml(5oz) Saucer diameter 10.8cmmaterials: Environmentally friendly porcelain.natural clay, Does not contain lead, mercury and other chemicals .high temperature firing. Widely used: suitable for brewing flower tea. Green tea (Tie Guanyin). Oolong tea.pu-er tea , black tea, white tea, yellow tea etc all kinds of loose tea. Package includes: 1* Lid 1* Cup 1* Saucer The Gaiwan is a traditional Chinese tea set with a lid on top, a tray on the bottom, and a bowl in the middle.Also known as \"Sancai bowl\", \"Sancai Cup\",The tea cover represents the sky, the saucer represents the earth, and the tea bowl represents human beings, implying that the heaven, the earth, and the earth are in harmony. What's so good about making tea in a tureen1.Covered bowl is suitable for all kinds of tea and convenient for cleaning The tureen is generally made of porcelain, with a bright, clean and dense surface that does not absorb flavor. The biggest advantage is that it is suitable for brewing any kind of tea. After brewing green tea, black tea can be brewed. In addition, the big mouth of the tureen makes the tea leaves come out with clean water. There is no need to pull the tea leaves as hard as a teapot, which is the favorite of lazy people. 2. It is convenient to make tea with covered bowl and flexible control The opening of the lid of the bowl can be adjusted at will. As long as it is controlled flexibly, the opening can be large or small, which can insulate tea residue to a certain extent. It can also adjust the water temperature and strength by changing the method of water injection, which can be applied to different kinds of tea.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617AeXpC7UL._AC_SL1322_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liang baobao","source_asin":"B08NYPG16J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NYPG16J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NYPG16J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
