window.products.push({"id":815908,"name":"Tactical Christmas Stockings, Personalized Molle Military Stocking, Decoration Soldier Army Stocking, Home Ornament (Army)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cNbokPxLL._AC_.jpg","description":"A unique military tactical style stocking. Our unique and creative stockings do away with the lanyard design of ordinary stockings and use high-quality buckles and handles to make the stockings tougher and more tactical. There are multiple elastic bands in the middle of the sock body, which can hold some small gifts, snacks and office supplies. There are also 2 large-capacity pockets below, which can store some small toys, gifts and snacks. Has Velcro in the middle of the pocket. At the bottom of the stockings, elastic bands and elastic ropes are added. The addition of these small elements makes the stockings more symmetrical and detailed. There are 2 options for the customization of stockings. No Personalization means that the stockings will be sent to you with a flag tag, while customization will lack the national flag. If you choose personalization, your name will be embroidered in the black leather flag. These beautiful personalized family stockings will be the perfect complement to your Christmas home decorations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cNbokPxLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BJKQZJ4L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJKQZJ4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJKQZJ4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":815909,"name":"Induna Arts South Africa African Shona Art Kissing Giraffes Stone Sculpture - Lips Touching - ~8.7\" Tall","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mGfJ37X5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The word Zimbabwe means house of stone based on the Great Zimbabwean ruins. The Shona have been stone carvers for centuries and are some the best stone carvers on the African continent. Giraffes are unique to Africa said to symbolize intuition. The giraffe is often used as a totem for people who are dynamic, farsighted and prone to visions. The giraffe is also considered a messenger that encourages us to broaden our horizons. The stone used for the carving is fetched from quarries which are sometimes up to 100 miles away from the village where the artist works. Each stone is different and contains a variety of colors, striations and naturally occurring lines. The sculptures are fragile. Kindly note that the dimensions may vary up to 1/2 an inch due to final finishing. - Shona sculpture is a unique form of art that stems from centuries of African tradition and cultural beliefs. Each piece is carefully crafted by artisans and have traveled from Africa across the world to bring a unique flair to any home or office. - Skillfully hand sculpted from Zimbabwean soapstone. - Great home decorative accent with an African flair. - Good home accent piece or gift for couples, newly-weds or weddings. - The handcrafted nature of these items will create variations in color, size and design. No two items are exactly the same. Items are grouped according to size, weight, color, and style. The photos shown are an accurate representation of the carving you will receive. Slight scuffs or feint hairline scratches are inherent to this product. Product Dimensions: Height 8.7\" Width: 3.9\" Depth/Length: 3.9\" Approximate weight without packaging: 1.3 lbs. Note: The photo shown of the item is an accurate representation of the sculpture being sold. Slight variations in color and size might occur.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mGfJ37X5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Induna Arts South Africa","source_asin":"B01FM2GSVA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FM2GSVA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FM2GSVA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
