window.products.push({"id":815956,"name":"The Display Guys –– Solid Pine Wood Picture Frame with Tempered Glass & Mat – Wall Mounting – 12\" x 16\" - White - 4 Pack Value Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tYcnkoZ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TEMPERED GLASS – Each picture frame from The Display Guys comes equipped with 2mm thick tempered glass glazing with high clarity, minimum distortion & scratch resistance.  Ensuring that you can protect cherished artworks and photographs with quality tempered glass that doesn’t shatter. MUSEUM QUALITY MAT – Museum-quality mat in creamy white. All mats are acid free to prevent damage to art displayed, and to extend lifespan of the piece. Mat features a mat opening about ½” smaller than the photo. 12\" x 16\" photos are matted to 8\" x 12\". MINIMALIST DESIGN – Keep it simple. Clean lines and a modern finish make frames from The Display Guys a perfect fit for any setting. Frames feature solid pine wood that blends perfectly with both traditional and modern décor. Crisp and elegantly crafted 0.75” clean-lined borders. SIZING – Display size is 12\" x 16\" , when matted the display is 8\" x 12\". Frames in size 8x10 and smaller come with an easel for easy table-top display. Finished with fine wood-grain texture, The Display Guys frame adds a splash of elegance to your space. Mat for 8\" x 12\" photos is 7.5\" x 11.5\". PRE-ASSEMBLED – Each frame comes equipped with a picture-frame wall mount. Pre-attached hardware fits for both vertical and horizontal wall hangings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tYcnkoZ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TheDisplayGuys For Your Modern Living","source_asin":"B094XMFXDT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094XMFXDT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094XMFXDT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":815957,"name":"Beeswax Chanukah Candles Standard Size Fits Most Menorahs - Multi Colored Beeswax Hanukkah Candles - Premium Quality Pure Bees Wax - 45 Count for All ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MK4wJP2WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIGHT UP THE NIGHT A favorite for so many, celebrating Chanuka is a highlight of the year. Of all the holiday traditions, kindling the Menorah is the main event. Lighting beeswax Hanukkah candles for menorah while reciting the blessings and singing traditional hymns brings the family and friends together to celebrate, young and old alike. Ner Mitzvah’s variety of beeswax Chanukah candles allows you to choose a size, color and design that you love to celebrate the holiday in style. Whether you prefer classic, traditional, colored, or modern candles hanukkah, we have the perfect candles to put the finishing touches on your menora and make it look spectacular.! Choose from chanukah candles standard size, chanukah candles white, natural beeswax hanukkah candles, fun multi-color designs, or funky themes. Celebrate the Festival of Lights with plenty of chanukah candles dripless to last you through all 8 nights, just like the miraculous oil jug in the Holy Temple. Our 45-count boxes include enough candles to light one menorah, including the shamash, on each night of the holiday. PRODUCT FEATURES: Kosher - Meets All Halachic RequirementsStays Lit for 1 HourPremium Quality BeeswWaxStandard Size 3/8” (10mm) DiameterFits Most Menorahs45 Count Per Box CUSTOMIZE YOUR CANDLES Kindle the perfect Chanuka candles to compliment your chanukiya & create a dazzling display! Choose from: Short 4” or Long 5” Multicolored, Blue & White, Metallic, Pastels or Natural Beeswax Chanukah Candles Straight & Smooth, Spiral, Wavy, Criss-Cross or Honeycomb Dreidel, Star of David, or “Happy Chanukah” Art ABOUT NER MITZVAH Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert candle-maker, delivering a wide selection of products at the highest quality with personal customer service. Count on us for Shabbat, Havdalah, and Chanukah candles and oil lamps as well as related Judaica.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MK4wJP2WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ner Mitzvah","source_asin":"B077D2CPZ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-815957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077D2CPZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077D2CPZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
